  "notes": [
    "Irregular -IR verb, part of the **-ducir** family (conducir, producir, reducir, traducir, seducir...)",
    "Presente yo form takes **-zco** (seduzco, not \"seduco\"); this irregular stem \"seduzc-\" carries through the entire subjuntivo presente (seduzca, seduzcas...)",
    "Pretérito indefinido uses the strong stem **seduj-** with the special ending set (-e, -iste, -o, -imos, -eron — no \"i\" before \"eron\", unlike regular -ir verbs)",
    "Regular past participle: **seducido**",
    "Related noun/adjective: **la seducción** (seduction), **seductor/seductora** (seductive, seducer)",
    "Common usage: *seducir a alguien con palabras* (to seduce/charm someone with words)"
  ],
